WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:02.901
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:04.300
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.467
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:07.133
President Biden kicked off

00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:09.501
House Democrats' 3-day retreat
tonight

00:00:09.501 --> 00:00:10.767
with a speech in Baltimore.

00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:13.200
Well, it was supposed to be
a one-day retreat,

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.234
but when that guy gets
talking...

00:00:15.234 --> 00:00:17.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:19.734
The Biden administration
said this week

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:22.434
that federal agencies will
have to remove TikTok

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:24.734
from all government devices
in 30 days,

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:26.801
and if they're smart, Venmo.

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:27.968
Matt?

00:00:27.968 --> 00:00:29.968
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:33.000
In a post yesterday
on Truth Social,

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.234
Former President Trump accused
Florida governor Ron DeSantis

00:00:36.234 --> 00:00:38.834
of wanting to cut
Social Security and Medicare,

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:42.767
and said he was a "wheelchair
over the cliff" kind of guy.

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:44.200
As opposed to Trump, who would

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.467
never waste a perfectly good
wheelchair.

00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:48.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.267 --> 00:00:52.167
Mexican President Lopez Obrador
pushed back against criticism

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:54.901
yesterday of his recent
electoral reforms and said,

00:00:54.901 --> 00:00:57.000
"There is more democracy
in Mexico

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.000
than could exist in
the United States."

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.067
Well, that's not the high bar
it used to be.

00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:03.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:04.734
That's like me saying I'm

00:01:04.734 --> 00:01:06.801
a better tennis player
than Richard Kind,

00:01:06.801 --> 00:01:09.367
who's backstage,

00:01:09.367 --> 00:01:11.200
and we're gonna find out
when he comes out

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:12.267
if he thinks he can
beat me in tennis,

00:01:12.267 --> 00:01:14.467
'cause I bet he probably could.

00:01:14.467 --> 00:01:16.868
During oral arguments yesterday
in a case challenging

00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:19.067
President Biden's student debt
forgiveness plan,

00:01:19.067 --> 00:01:21.400
Supreme Court Justice
Neil Gorsuch

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:24.167
said the program was unfair
and failed to take into account

00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:26.934
people who had paid off
their loans or never had them.

00:01:26.934 --> 00:01:29.400
Yeah, can someone for once

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:32.968
think of the people
who never had student loans?

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:35.968
When do they get a break?

00:01:35.968 --> 00:01:37.901
That's like saying no Tinder,

00:01:37.901 --> 00:01:40.767
it's not fair to the people
who already get laid.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.734 --> 00:01:45.968
Television provider Dish Network
confirmed yesterday

00:01:45.968 --> 00:01:48.200
that a previous outage
was caused by

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:51.133
a cybersecurity breach,
and not, as customers assumed,

00:01:51.133 --> 00:01:52.467
by a gentle rain.

00:01:52.467 --> 00:01:55.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.968 --> 00:01:58.667
Dictionary.com yesterday
unveiled new entries,

00:01:58.667 --> 00:01:59.868
including the word "woke."

00:01:59.868 --> 00:02:02.100
"Still not gonna look it up!"
said Republicans.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.834 --> 00:02:06.667
A Florida woman was arrested
last week

00:02:06.667 --> 00:02:09.300
after she told deputies
during a traffic stop

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:11.000
she had drugs in
her body cavity,

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:14.934
and removed nearly 11 grams
of crystal meth.

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:17.300
Said the cops,
"Ma'am, we pulled you over

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:18.567
for a broken tail light."

00:02:18.567 --> 00:02:22.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.234 --> 00:02:26.100
"Still, pretty impressive,
though, officers."

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:28.267
Fast food chain KFC
today announced

00:02:28.267 --> 00:02:31.033
the return of the Double Down,
a bun-free sandwich

00:02:31.033 --> 00:02:33.000
that substitutes bread
with chicken,

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.067
so you can substitute
hunger with self-loathing.

00:02:36.067 --> 00:02:37.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.534 --> 00:02:40.667
And finally, the pharmaceutical
company Eli Lilly

00:02:40.667 --> 00:02:41.834
announced today that it will cap

00:02:41.834 --> 00:02:44.601
the out-of-pocket cost
of insulin at $35 --

00:02:44.601 --> 00:02:46.934
and not a moment too soon.

00:02:46.934 --> 00:02:49.634
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

00:02:49.634 --> 00:02:50.634
We're off and running.

